{"title":"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A coin of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is flipped onto an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c58a4fa43c595b7d97db5c954aef623ea91ab739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500 \\times 500$\" width=\"76\" height=\"12\" /> square grid divided into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b32623c3d21608acb59f855590c5b920018645a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2500$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> equal squares. Circles are inscribed in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> of these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b32623c3d21608acb59f855590c5b920018645a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2500$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> squares. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c51a4acedda645113145d008dbfb50d35f1da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> be the probability that, given that the coin lands completely within one of the smaller squares, it also lands completely within one of the circles. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the probability that, when flipped onto the grid, the coin lands completely within one of the smaller squares. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2f0c6d216bb63a89845904c513ec0007b6b3e7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/a/75aa7191374607aea2f02836298203ebba8368cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_n &gt; P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/b/4fb30465df8866902b297e660b6fbbd8306bf723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor \\frac{n_0}{3} \\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"37\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006\">Mock AIME 5 2005-2006</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=76847\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Proble